blocks.en:
Future-cohort performance is attribute- and cohort-dependent: breed declines;
the mean weight and age results fail to beat constant baselines in 2025;
height remains above baseline; and color transfers well to 2025 but declines in
2026. We also compare single- and multi-task training, still-view aggregation,
and zero-shot aggregation of sparse video frames.

blocks.zh:
未来加速性能取决于属性和组群:品种减少;
平均体重和年龄结果未能超过2025年的恒定基线;
高度仍然高于基线;到2025年颜色转移情况良好,但
2026 (英语). 我们还比较单任务和多任务培训、静视汇总,
和零发集合 稀有的视频帧。

